    "prompt": "Explanation: Subjective data are the information that the client provides to the nurse, such as their symptoms, feelings, preferences and beliefs. Objective data are the information that the nurse obtains through observation, examination, measurement and testing, such as vital signs, laboratory results, physical findings and diagnostic images. 23 23 79. What is the first step of the nursing process?",
